Package: sisabextrator
Title: Interface R para Extracao e Consulta de Dados Publicos do SISAB
Version: 0.2.3
Authors@R: person(given = "Maicon", family = "Carlos", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "143948074+maiconcarlospng@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Disponibiliza funcoes para executar o extrator Python de relatorios
    publicos agregados do SISAB, criar planos de consultas, baixar resultados,
    consolidar arquivos Parquet por ano e pela serie historica e ler conjuntos
    Parquet com Apache Arrow sem materializar toda a base em memoria.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    rlang
Suggests:
    arrow,
    dplyr,
    remotes
URL: https://github.com/maiconcarlospng/sisab-extrator
BugReports: https://github.com/maiconcarlospng/sisab-extrator/issues
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.10) and Git for downloading from SISAB
